    "Part of wordfreq's data: the SUBTLEX word lists by Marc Brysbaert et al., which are freely available (crr.ugent.be), and subtitles from OpenSubtitles (opensubtitles.org) through OPUS. wordfreq also draws on Wikipedia, Google Books Ngram Viewer (books.google.com/ngrams), the Leeds Internet Corpus and ParaCrawl." : {
